      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2 : Overall architecture of SafeDrive. ProposalNet evaluates the scene-level safety of anchor trajectories using BEV features and selects safety-aware candidates.\nSWNet constructs trajectory-conditioned Sparse Worlds by simulating the future behaviors of dynamic agents and road entities.\nFRNet performs fine-grained safety reasoning by estimating pair-wise No Collision scores and evaluating Time-wise Drivable Area Compliance scores over time, enabling interpretable and temporally grounded safety assessment.",
