      "caption": "Figure 2. VIRAL teacher-student pipeline. Phase 1: In simulation, a privileged RL teacher policy ωteacher receives full-state proprioception and exteroception of the task information and outputs WBC commands. Phase 2: A vision-based student policy ωstudent observes only RGB images and sim-to-real proprioception and is trained to imitate the teacher policy via DAgger and behavior cloning.",
