      "figure": "Figure 3",
      "caption": "Figure 3. Overview of REALM. Top: Global-to-Local Spatial Grounding (GLSpaG) pipline hierarchically aggregates the outputs of LMSeg agents from global context to local refinement. Bottom left: We optimize a 3D feature field from 2D SAM masks for 3D consistent identification. Bottom right: MLLM-based Visual Segmenter (LMSeg) performs image-level reasoning on one viewpoint and integrates identity information from the optimized feature field to determine the selected instance ID.",
