      "caption": "Figure 2 : Overview of the proposed NullSteer framework.\nGiven multimodal inputs, image and text embeddings are encoded and fed into the large language model. During inference, NullSteer applies activation steering within the null space of benign representations, ensuring that harmful activations are redirected toward refusal semantics while preserving benign behaviors.",
