      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2. Overview of our framework. We extract a pyramidal feature map {Fl}L l=1 from a slide image I and progressively decode them into a gene expression map G using multiple separable attention fusion blocks (SAFBs). The predicted gene expression values {ˆyn}N n=1 are aggregated (Eq. 9) from G based on the positions and radiuses of spots of interest. The loss L is computed sparsely on spots with ground truth gene expression {yn}N n=1 during training.",
