    "id": "cvpr26-0149a608aab5",
    "extraction": {
      "id": "cvpr26-0149a608aab5",
      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2. Overview of the proposed InterPrior framework. It con- sists of: (I) full-reference imitation expert training on large-scale human-object interaction data; (II) distillation of the expert into a variational policy with a structured latent space for skill embed- dings; and (III) post-training of the variational policy to enhance generalization. Blue modules denote the ﬁnal policy used at in- ference; green and red modules are training-only components, and red arrows denote supervision signals (rewards/losses).",
