    "id": "cvpr26-66405392b057",
    "extraction": {
      "id": "cvpr26-66405392b057",
      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2. SpaceDrive framework. Beyond the base VLM, a frozen depth estimator predicts dense metric depths from surround-view images, which are projected into 3D coordinates and encoded by a universal PE encoder to augment visual tokens with spatial cues. BEV coordinates in text prompts are encoded by the same PE encoder, replacing the original coordinate tokens and preceded by the PE indicator ⟨IND⟩. At the output stage, the recognized PE is passed through a PE decoder to obtain the final coordinates for trajectory planning.",
      "page": 3,
      "captionRect": [
