      "figure": "Figure 6",
      "caption": "Figure 6. Framework of Hi-GRPO. In Step 1, we instruct the model to generate high-level semantic reasoning based on the 3D prompt, and use it together with the prompt to produce a coarse 3D shape. In Step 2, conditioned on the 3D prompt and the high-level semantic CoT, the model generates low-level visual reasoning focused on local appearance details, which is used to produce the refined 3D object.",
