      "id": "cvpr26-12f3e5dc4089",
      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2. Overview of B3-Seg. (1) Sample Ncand candidate views on a sphere centered at the estimated object center cobj. (2) Render each candidate to compute EIG(v) by Eq. (11), and pick the best view vω (red). On vω, obtain masks using Grounded SAM2 and CLIP reranking. (3) From the mask, compute (ei,1, ei,0) by Eq. (5) and update Beta parameters. We iterate (1)–(3) process 20 steps. The pipeline enables camera-free, training-free, open-vocabulary 3DGS segmentation in a few seconds.",
      "page": 3,
