      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2. Overview of our Lyapunov Probing framework. Multi-layer hidden states and perturbation information are fed into a probe network comprising a transformer-based HiddenProcessor and an MLP-based Classifier. The framework is trained with stability-driven objectives that enforce monotonic confidence decay, distinguishing stable factual regions from unstable hallucination-prone regions.",
