      "id": "cvpr26-1dc14aa82c1e",
      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2. The pipeline of TALK2MOVE. TALK2MOVE streamlines a GRPO-style reinforcement learning pipeline tailored for flow-based image editing. Starting from an initial noise sample, stochastic perturbations are injected at each diffusion step to generate diverse sampling trajectories. Spatially grounded rewards from specialist models, which explicitly evaluate object-level geometric changes, are then used to compute group-relative advantages for policy gradient updates.",
      "page": 4,
