      "id": "cvpr26-f9088de3ab0f",
      "figure": "Figure 3",
      "caption": "Figure 3. Pipeline of MedTVT-R1. Pretraining processes ECG, CXR, and LAB data through encoders and projectors, combined with prompts, to train projectors and LLM’s LoRA for enhanced physiological understanding. The SFT stage adds a Modality Perception Layer for interaction and integration, refining disease analysis. The RFT stage applies GRPO, using the SFT-trained model for policy and inference, optimizing KL divergence and reward loss.",
