      "figure": "Figure 3",
      "caption": "Figure 3 : VidEoMT architecture. For the initial video frame at t = 0 t=0 , learnable queries are concatenated to the patch tokens after the first L 1 L_{1} ViT blocks. Both sets of tokens are then jointly processed in the last L 2 L_{2} blocks, outputting predictions and track queries. For successive frames, learnable queries and previous-frame track queries are fed to the query fusion module before being processed by the ViT blocks.",
