    "extraction": {
      "figure": "Figure 2",
      "caption": "Figure 2 : Overview of Flickerformer.\n(a) The proposed Flickerformer adopts an asymmetric U-shaped encoder–decoder architecture. Following the previous work [ 55 ] , the input consists of three frames, while the output is a single restored frame.\n(b) The proposed phase fusion module (PFM), which performs feature fusion based on phase correlation. The operation of the phase spectral filtering (PSF) corresponds to Eqs. 2 and 3 , and the fusion module corresponds to Eq. 5 .\n(c) The proposed wavelet-based directional attention module (WDAM), including a low-frequency attention branch and a high-frequency branch to capture directional features.",
      "image_url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2603.22794v1/model4.png",
